⚙️ Working

The program works as follows:

1. "Person" stores the person's name.
2. "Student" and "Employee" virtually inherit from "Person".
3. "TeachingAssistant" inherits from both "Student" and "Employee".
4. Due to virtual inheritance, only one copy of "Person" is present in "TeachingAssistant".
5. "TeachingAssistant" directly initializes the "Person" constructor with the name "Riya".
6. The "displayName()" function displays the person's name.

